   "stem_html": "Jim Crow is best described as",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1173379,
     "content_html": "a comic book character who stereotyped African Americans as less intelligent"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173380,
     "content_html": "the systematic segregation and/or exclusion of African Americans in the South"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173378,
     "content_html": "a genre of southern folk songs that called for segregation of the races"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173377,
     "content_html": "a famous African American baseball player from the nineteenth century"
    }
